cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use hadome, please cite it as below.
title: hadome
type: software
authors:
  - alias: rerorets
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3311-1418
abstract: >-
  A ratcheting checker that compares a change against the base branch and
  fails only on regressions: the violations the change adds and the tests it
  weakens. It reads Go, TypeScript, Python, Rust, Java, Kotlin, Terraform and
  Ansible without running the tests.
repository-code: https://github.com/rerorets/hadome
url: https://github.com/rerorets/hadome
license: MIT
keywords:
  - static analysis
  - testing
  - mutation testing
  - regression testing
  - ratchet
  - AI coding agents
